{
  "ALL_TEXT": "75 INT. BABA'S ASHRAM-GUEST AUDIENCE CHAMBERS - DAY\nVEDA and GOVARDHAN are sent into CHINTHAN BABA's private\nchambers immediately. CHINTHAN BABA is in his early 40s.\nSlightly effeminate, but only to the trained eye. CHINTHAN\nBABA is seated on a recliner; he looks composed. As VEDA\nenters the room, CHINTHAN BABA acknowledges him with a nod.\nHe opens his eyes to see GOVARDHAN, soon after which his\nexpression changes. CHINTHAN BABA looks at him a split second\nlonger than usual and smiles a mildly strange smile. Only the\nreceiver of the smile would know its crookedness.\nCHINTHAN BABA\n(Looking at GOVARDHAN\nlongingly)\nMeelo VEDA SHANKAR evaru?\nVEDA wondering why CHINTHAN BABA is paying so much attention\nto GOVARDHAN.\nVEDA\n...Nene Baba... mee tho koncham\npani padindhi Baba.. Peddhadhi\nkaadhu... Chinnadhe...\nCHINTHAN BABA\nPani cheppu VEDA. Peddadha\nchinnadha taravaatha\naalochiddhaam...\nVEDA\nEeyana peru GOVARDHAN\nVEDA pulls out GOVARDHAN, who has been hiding behind him.\nCHINTHAN BABA\n(slowly)\nAhh telusu Govardhan Anandam\nSharma.... hmmm.... cheppu.\nGOVARDHAN is extremely uncomfortable, and has his own doubts\nabout CHINTHAN BABA. He notices the little finger's nail of\nCHINTHAN BABA's left hand is painted light pink.\nVEDA\nPoddunna chinna godava ayyindi\nBaba...\nVEDA trails off explaining things. GOVARDHAN looks on in\nfear.\nVEDA\n...aithe maa thappu lekunda memu\nirukkupoyi...\nCHINTHAN BABA\nIppudu maa tho em pani?\nVEDA\n. Baba meeru thaluchukuntey\naedhaina saadhyame...\nCHINTHAN BABA looks towards GOVARDHAN, who is fidgeting next\nto VEDA.\nCHINTHAN BABA\nVEDA mammalni maatlaadanisthaava?\nGOVARDHAN\nAaynani maatlaadani ayya!.\nThondaragaa ayipogottukuni veldaam\nCHINTHAN BABA is surprised by GOVARDHAN being rude. He looks\nat VEDA and smiles.\nCHINTHAN BABA\nPaapam intha pedda pramaadham lo\nchikkukunnaaru...\nCHINTHAN BABA\nSahaayam cheyaalani enduku undadhu,\naevariki undadu?\nVEDA smiles happily, relaxed.\nCHINTHAN BABA\nGOVARDHAN gaaru... maatho untaara\nikkada?\nGOVARDHAN is mortified. VEDA is surprised. GOVARDHAN looks at\nCHINTHAN BABA with intense hatred; this amuses CHINTHAN BABA.\nHe lowers his eyes and stares at CHINTHAN BABA's painted nail- his despise for CHINTHAN BABA turns into hatred and immense\nfear.\nCHINTHAN BABA\n..ha! ha!. enno rojulu kaadu! Ee\npoota ikkade maatho undi\nsaayanthraaniki bayaluderudu le!\nMaaku seva chesthe entho\npunyam....aashirvadam ichi prasadam\npadetha...\nGOVARDHAN turns to look at VEDA angrily.\nVEDA\n(Trying to impress\nCHINTHAN BABA)\nAvunu GOVARDHAN! Baba ki seva chese\npunyam adrushtam andariki\ndorakadhu. Endaru eduru chusthaaro\nthelusa ee avakaasaaniki?\nGOVARDHAN\n(With a cold stare)\nNuvvu cheyyi seva!\nVEDA\nAntha adrushtama naaku baba!\nCHINTHAN BABA ignores VEDA\u2019s statement\nCHINTHAN BABA\nYe GOVARDHAN! Naa sahaayaniki\nkruthagnatha chuaavaa?.\nThe phone starts ringing - its screen flashes \"FOREST\nMINISTER\".\nCHINTHAN BABA\nAayane chesthunnaaru...\nethamantaava GOVARDHAN?\nVEDA nudges GOVARDHAN. Tension mounts. VEDA is annoyed at\nGOVARDHAN refusing such a simple request.\nVEDA\n(whispers)\nNee sommemanna pothada oh ghanta\nseva chesthe!? Paiga entha punyam!\nGOVARDHAN\n(whispers)\nAasthi raasi istha ani cheppu\nkaavaalante. Naakee punyam oddu.\nVEDA\n(whispers)\nNee abba! Okka saari... okka saari\nco-operate cheyi GOVARDHAN . Inka\nidi last. Aa tharavaatha nijanga\nokari mohaalu okaram chudaalsina\navasaram undadu.\nGOVARDHAN\nSare.\nVEDA\n(to CHINTHAN BABA)\nBaba aayanaki phone chesi chepthara\nippdudu?\nCHINTHAN BABA\nMundu aashirvadam ichi prasadam\npettani...\nCUT TO:",
